    "description": "Backend endpoints plus the three external APIs the work-link feature depends on.\n\nNO SECRETS IN THIS FILE. Fill spotifyClientId, spotifyClientSecret, youtubeApiKey and\ngeminiApiKey from .env in the collection variables before running the External folders.\nThis file is committed to the repo - never save real keys into it.\n\nOrder: Auth > Send OTP, then Verify OTP (it auto-saves the JWT into {{token}}).\n\nNote: .env currently has OTP_PROVIDER=sms, so the OTP arrives by real SMS and is NOT echoed\nin the response. Set OTP_PROVIDER=mock for local testing and it comes back in the body.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
